    /// A run that frees can reach its peak and let it go between two of the stride's samples; it
    /// can't between an allocation and this. Unbudgeted runs leave it to the stride.'''
new='''    /// A box was made or grew, or a row made a text: where memory crosses a run's byte budget, so
    /// where it's held to it. A run that frees can reach its peak and let it go between two of the
    /// stride's samples; it can't between an allocation and this. Text is held at the one door
    /// every row's answer passes (`called_row`); a constant text allocates nothing, and what crosses
    /// in is the run's input, never charged. Unbudgeted runs leave it to the stride.'''
assert s.count(old)==1; s=s.replace(old,new)
open(p,'w').write(s)
